# Learn With Why: the Supabase project the built website talks to (npm run build reads this file).
# Both values are PUBLIC by design: every VITE_ value ends up in the JavaScript that visitors
# download, so this file is safe on GitHub. NEVER put a secret here: no sb_secret_ or
# service_role key, no Razorpay, Stripe, PayPal or email key. Those go only in Supabase
# (Edge Functions -> Secrets) or on your own computer when a setup step asks for one.
#
# The site calls the project's "api" Edge Function at VITE_SUPABASE_URL + /functions/v1.
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY is the project's publishable key, used by src/lib/supabase.js.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://liaqgyskuhnxmlvmrnrl.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_la_ugszxVu2H23l5DBzmdQ_IdvFRkmG
